/ A random table with a column of (nearly) every data type, built from `?`
/ (roll) and string vectors. Values change on every run.
/ Each `zip` value is one noun, so a compound expression goes in parens.
n: 5000

/ `zip` builds i64 / f64 / bool / str columns; the temporal and narrower types
/ are then cast onto the raw values (ns since midnight / the epoch, days, ...)
t: zip `id`i8`i32`px`f32`flag`sym`cat`str`day`tm`ts`span!
    (til n)
    (n ? 100)
    (n ? 100000)
    (n ? 500.0)
    (n ? 1.0)
    (n ? 01b)
    (n ? `buy`sell`hold)
    (n ? `red`green`blue)
    (n ? ("alpha" "beta" "gamma" "delta"))
    (19000 + n ? 1000)
    ((n ? 86400) * 1000000000)
    ((1700000000 + n ? 100000000) * 1000000000)
    ((n ? 1000) * 1000000)

t: update i8: i8$i8, i32: i32$i32, f32: f32$f32, cat: `$cat, day: `date$day, tm: `time$tm, ts: `timestamp$ts, span: `timespan$span from t

/ show every column rather than eliding the middle ones
.qpl.cfg maxcol=20 tblwidth=200
t
cols t
